  "id": "vibration",
  "term": "vibration",
  "definition": "The packet uses vibration to mean the dynamic motion or oscillation of a physical structure, measured as signals that can be analysed for changes over time and across frequency bands. In this context, patterns in vibration are used as input for automated detection of structural damage, not for a psychological or counselling concept.",
